  "prompt": "<p>X₁, …, X₁₀ are i.i.d. Uniform(0, θ). Two unbiased estimators of θ:</p><ul><li>A = 2x̄ (method of moments)</li><li>B = ((n+1)/n)·max(Xᵢ)</li></ul><p>Compute the ratio MSE(A) / MSE(B) for n = 10.</p>",
