  "prompt": "<p>Waiting times (in minutes) between trades are modelled as i.i.d. Exponential(λ) with density λe^(−λx). You observe 2, 3, 5, 10.</p><p>What is the maximum-likelihood estimate of λ (per minute)?</p>",
