  "solution": "<p>EV per $1: 0.4·2 − 0.6 = 0.2 &gt; 0, so you should bet something.</p><p>Maximize g(f) = p ln(1 + bf) + q ln(1 − f): setting g′ = 0 gives f* = p − q/b.</p><p>f* = 0.4 − 0.6/2 = 0.1.</p><p><b>Answer: 0.1 (10% of bankroll).</b></p>",
