  "prompt": "<p>A company's value to its owner is V ~ Uniform(0, 100), known only to the owner. Under your management it would be worth 1.8V + 10. You make one take-it-or-leave-it bid b; the owner sells if and only if b ≥ V, and you then pay b. Which bid maximises your expected profit, and what is that expected profit?</p><p>Answer as two numbers separated by a comma: optimal bid, expected profit.</p>",
