  "prompt": "<p>You are selling an item. Offers arrive one at a time, i.i.d. Uniform(0, 1). Each offer costs you 0.005 to obtain (including the first). You must accept or reject each offer when it arrives, and rejected offers are gone. You want to maximise (accepted offer − total cost). What is the optimal acceptance threshold, and how many offers do you expect to see?</p><p>Answer as two numbers separated by a comma: threshold, expected number of offers.</p>",
