  "style": [
   "brainteaser-phone",
   "coding-screen"
  ],
  "prompt": "<p>You have <b>three</b> identical eggs and a 100-storey building. There is some floor F (from 0 to 100) such that an egg survives a drop from floor F and below, and breaks from any higher floor. A broken egg cannot be reused. What is the minimum number of drops that guarantees you find F in the worst case?</p><p>Give a whole number.</p>",
