  "prompt": "<p>A post office sells only 5-cent and 8-cent stamps. What is the largest postage (in cents) that <b>cannot</b> be made exactly, and how many positive postages cannot be made at all?</p><p>Give the two answers as comma-separated values: largest impossible amount, number of impossible amounts.</p>",
