  "prompt": "<p>You are offered a single bet: stake $10,000; with probability 0.6 you win $20,000 profit, otherwise you lose the stake. You are a log-utility (Kelly) bettor with total wealth W ≥ $10,000. What is the smallest W at which you would accept?</p><p>Give a number in dollars (3 significant figures is fine).</p>",
