  "style": [
   "market-making-game",
   "OA-speed"
  ],
  "prompt": "<p>An asset will be worth 94 or 106, each with probability ½. You quote 100 − h @ 100 + h. 70% of traders are uninformed (buy/sell ½ each) and 30% know the value and trade in the profitable direction.</p><p>What is the smallest total width 2h at which your expected P&L per trader is zero? Give a number.</p>",
