  "prompt": "<p>You quote 6.5 @ 7.5 for one unit of a contract paying the sum of two fair dice. Your counterparty secretly sees the first die before deciding. They buy at your ask, sell at your bid, or pass, whichever has the highest expected profit for them (they pass when neither side has strictly positive expected profit).</p><p>What is your expected P&L? Give a signed number.</p>",
