  "prompt": "<p>You start flat. Each incoming trade is equally likely to be a buy or a sell of one unit from you, independently, so your position moves +1 or −1. You stop quoting as soon as your position reaches +5 or −5.</p><p>What is the expected number of trades before you stop? Give a number.</p>",
