  "prompt": "<p>An asset is worth 120 with probability 0.3 and 80 with probability 0.7. 40% of traders know the value (buy if 120, sell if 80); the rest buy or sell with probability ½. You set ask = E[V | buy] and bid = E[V | sell].</p><p>Answer as two numbers separated by a comma: bid, ask (to 2 decimals).</p>",
