  "solution": "<p>CE(q) = 50q − ½·0.1·0.2·q² = 50q − 0.01q².</p><p>Bid = CE(11) − CE(10) = 50 − 0.01·21 = 49.79. Ask = CE(10) − CE(9) = 50 − 0.01·19 = 49.81. Reservation mid r = 49.80 = 50 − qγσ²τ.</p><p>Quoting 1 wide: 49.3 @ 50.3. Being long, you shade the whole market down by 0.2 to attract buyers.</p><p><b>Answer: 49.3, 50.3.</b></p>",
